### Stepper Typography
- Step Numbers: text-sm font-medium
- Step Titles: text-sm font-medium
- Step Descriptions: text-xs font-normal

### Stepper Spacing
- Between Steps: gap-4 (16px)
- Circle to Text: ml-3 (12px)
- Connector Lines: mx-4 (16px)
- Vertical Step Gap: gap-4 (16px)

### Stepper Colors
- Active Step: primary color (#303F9F)
- In Progress: primary color with 20% opacity
- Waiting: gray-100 (#F7FAFC)
- Connector Lines: gray-200 (#E2E8F0)
- Text Colors: Use content color scale

