### Dropdown Spacing
- Menu Item Padding: px-4 py-2 (16px horizontal, 8px vertical)
- Group Spacing: py-2 (8px vertical)
- Icon Spacing: mr-2 (8px right margin)
- Search Input Padding: px-2 py-1.5 (8px horizontal, 6px vertical)

